From 4622954a6eacf3af49c85951348d17ba2d861eaa Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mitch Johnston <mitch.johnston25@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 20:14:42 +1030
Subject: [PATCH] qt: Juxtopposed keyboard shortcuts dialog

Adds a QML keyboard shortcuts dialog matching the redesign: hotkeys and global hotkeys grouped by purpose, search with a field scope, press-a-key editing that frees a key already used by another action, and Save/Cancel that writes through VLCSettings. It opens from the Controls settings page and a new Tools > Keyboard Shortcuts menu entry via DialogsProvider::hotkeysDialog(), which falls back to the classic preferences when no QML dialog is connected. Also adds an edit (pencil) glyph to the icon font.
